Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mess 'em up good, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear a path for me, and be quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gearing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's a Popsicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those vibrations can't\Nbe frozen. Tough luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Kuzan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been stabbed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To thou keep you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Icelock! Partison!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! I'll fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I had him. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The scaffold is straight ahead, but first\Nwe need to break through these cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You and the rest of\Nthe filthy pirate scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Marjorie and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those times are on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything\Nwill take what I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what, I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go. There's\Nnothing that can stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, I, Momonga, am the\NNavy Vice Admiral who will cut you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, the same rank as Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Move off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Second year!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Drawhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp, don't you dare forget\Nwhose side you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're full of courage, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But take this word of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:07:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're simply not strong enough,\Nno matter how courageous you may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't even come close to saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Ace's brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, seems the white beard brand\Nis losing some of its punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you could have done better than\Nlet that youngster lead the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy is hardly breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's partially my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Pops, let's block the beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What a devoted crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've spotted him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over there, Team Bay! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And where is it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you Luffy\Nwas going to be in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That face, why is it so gigantic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I think it just does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he still alive? Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, easy does it! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You are wasting our time! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this little Fall belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva, Jinbe, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, let go of my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so close to him! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done his fair share of good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat him. No! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Koza needs me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my only brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta... I promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ate him quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Sergeant!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do everything within\Nyour power to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with us, friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nothing but a big-mouthed\Nkid who goes looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumb and clumsy. Careless, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.08,0:10:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got a soft\Nspot for fools like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're ready to die,\Nstep up and meet your maker!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you're always sailing\Naround wreaking havoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But here, you're through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think. I'll be right back.\NYou wait here. Hold on. You're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I must I won't rest until Ace is safe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from him it's too dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.63,0:11:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops is coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You think yourself brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you had any pride as swordsman,\Nyou'd know when to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolent wretches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I shall smite every\Nman that stands between us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's attacking both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa Hancock's completely lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone cover your eyes, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Slave arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely. The corpse\Ncount's still on the rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit moving around! You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure feels like I'm roaming free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on the alert, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the new world pirates\Nthat were trapped in the bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We turned away for one\Nsecond and this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle is not gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We better clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy to our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's fine if a few soldiers\Nget caught up in the crossfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Pacifistas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you winning, Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going straight through him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I never gave you orders to start fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to fight Monkey D. Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary Navy hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Life cycle. Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this now! They're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the best gatekeeper there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to reach the scaffold, you're\Ngonna have to make it through me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid brats.
